---
title: "Sequence: search and filter the car listing"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Customer
    participant B as Browser
    participant P as car-listing.php
    participant I as price-insights.php
    participant DB as MySQL
    U->>B: choose type / brand / fuel / budget, sort by price
    B->>P: GET car-listing?type=SUV&max=7500&sort=price_asc
    P->>P: whitelist every parameter (types, brands, budgets, sorts)
    P->>DB: SELECT active cars JOIN brands WHERE ... (prepared, bound values)
    P->>I: car_price_info(id) for each car
    I->>DB: forecast rows of the next 30 days (once per request)
    I-->>P: 'from' price (lowest available day), badges
    P->>P: budget filter and price sort on the 'from' price, paging
    P-->>B: cards with "from Rs X/day", badges, canonical/noindex tags
